WEBVTT

00:00:09.142 --> 00:00:11.144
Love, Just on my love

00:00:11.144 --> 00:00:17.484
I want to protect you with these hands

00:00:27.661 --> 00:00:31.765
Do you know real men?

00:00:31.765 --> 00:00:35.903
They're weak to the women they protect

00:00:35.903 --> 00:00:40.107
Is he sweeter than me?

00:00:40.107 --> 00:00:44.211
Is he stronger than me?

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:50.984
The night of the full moon is cold

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:53.887
My soul is supposed to be in my hands

00:00:54.788 --> 00:01:03.263
My memories get moved to the shadows

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:07.334
Love, Just on my love

00:01:07.334 --> 00:01:13.373
I want to protect you with these hands

00:01:13.674 --> 00:01:21.949
You taught me about women, love, and passion

00:01:40.634 --> 00:01:41.602
Delicious!

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:30.017
Who's there?

00:02:33.654 --> 00:02:34.488
Sorry!

00:02:36.089 --> 00:02:38.091
| didn't mean to surprise you!

00:02:38.625 --> 00:02:39.960
Don't run!

00:02:40.594 --> 00:02:42.062
I'm Majic.

00:02:42.062 --> 00:02:44.798
I'm on a journey with my master.

00:02:45.499 --> 00:02:48.301
From the outside world?

00:02:48.468 --> 00:02:50.037
Outside world?

00:03:00.847 --> 00:03:06.853
The priestess
EMBRACED BY A ORAGON

00:03:16.697 --> 00:03:18.932
Majic's late.

00:03:23.737 --> 00:03:26.373
I'm not, you know, a suspicious person.

00:03:26.373 --> 00:03:27.974
Quiet, sorcerer!

00:03:27.974 --> 00:03:30.844
Well, I'm still an apprentice.

00:03:31.278 --> 00:03:34.581
But how did you know that I was a sorcerer?

00:03:34.581 --> 00:03:36.550
This forest is our forest!

00:03:36.550 --> 00:03:39.319
It's not a place for a sorcerer like you to come!

00:03:39.319 --> 00:03:41.254
| was only looking for food.

00:03:41.588 --> 00:03:43.256
We kill all sorcerers!

00:03:43.256 --> 00:03:44.591
W-wait a minute!

00:03:48.361 --> 00:03:50.864
| think you should watch out
for what's above your heads.

00:03:51.264 --> 00:03:52.299
You!

00:03:52.299 --> 00:03:53.700
Now or never!

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:55.902
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:04:03.009 --> 00:04:04.244
It worked!

00:04:11.985 --> 00:04:15.889
Your magic, or my gun's trigger.
Wonder which one's faster?

00:04:18.258 --> 00:04:19.526
You sorcerer!

00:04:20.961 --> 00:04:23.163
Did you hear something just now?

00:04:23.163 --> 00:04:25.365
Don't act so nonchalant!

00:04:25.365 --> 00:04:27.567
Hurry up and do something about these guys!

00:04:31.338 --> 00:04:32.439
Herr Batrov!

00:04:33.974 --> 00:04:35.175
Master...

00:04:35.575 --> 00:04:37.778
If you're anticipating help, don't count on it.

00:04:37.778 --> 00:04:41.014
My men are on their way to
dispatch the rest of the sorcerers.

00:04:47.454 --> 00:04:49.456
Go to Hell, just ahead of the rest.

00:04:51.658 --> 00:04:52.592
You mustn't!

00:04:54.161 --> 00:04:55.162
Lady Fiena!

00:04:56.763 --> 00:04:58.265
Please release him.

00:04:58.765 --> 00:05:00.801
But he's a sorcerer!

00:05:00.801 --> 00:05:02.736
Sorcerers are enemies of the village.

00:05:02.736 --> 00:05:04.004
It's all right.

00:05:04.004 --> 00:05:06.873
He isn't the type of person
who would harm the village.

00:05:06.873 --> 00:05:08.675
But the law is the law.

00:05:09.409 --> 00:05:13.914
No matter what the reason, anyone who
sets foot in this forest shall be executed.

00:05:13.914 --> 00:05:15.482
Yeah! That's right! That's right!

00:05:16.449 --> 00:05:18.652
You mean to say that you
cannot heed my words?

00:05:20.921 --> 00:05:24.457
We are bound not to disobey
the words of Lady Fiena.

00:05:25.358 --> 00:05:27.360
But it's dangerous to let him go.

00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:29.196
We'll take him back, and confine him.

00:05:29.696 --> 00:05:30.964
Dragon Faith?

00:05:30.964 --> 00:05:34.835
Obviously, they really don't care for sorcerers,
so I'm sure I'm not mistaken.

00:05:35.235 --> 00:05:38.371
This forest is where the
Dragon Faith's village is hidden.

00:05:38.972 --> 00:05:41.241
Well, I guess it's only natural
that they dislike you,

00:05:41.241 --> 00:05:43.844
after the way you treat them so horribly.

00:05:43.844 --> 00:05:44.945
You too.

00:05:49.516 --> 00:05:53.486
But why do those of the
Dragon Faith dislike sorcerers?

00:05:53.486 --> 00:05:56.590
I've told you what the Dragon Tribe
is like before, haven't I?

00:05:58.058 --> 00:06:02.562
The tribe that stole the power of magic
from the gods long ago right?

00:06:04.464 --> 00:06:08.435
They fought a fierce battle with
the followers of the gods,

00:06:08.435 --> 00:06:11.104
and then made this continent,
Kielsalhima, their home.

00:06:13.006 --> 00:06:17.043
People received the magical power
from the Wheeled Dragon, right?

00:06:17.344 --> 00:06:21.248
Right. We sorcerers were first born
as the result of interbreeding

00:06:21.248 --> 00:06:23.984
between humans and
those of the Dragon Tribe.

00:06:23.984 --> 00:06:28.355
We're the only race outside of the
Dragon Tribe that's capable of using magic.

00:06:28.955 --> 00:06:34.794
A number of the Dragon Tribe
don't think well of us sorcerers.

00:06:35.128 --> 00:06:36.429
Why?

00:06:36.429 --> 00:06:37.631
Who knows?

00:06:37.631 --> 00:06:42.402
But a long time ago the Dragon Tribe
bestowed weapons made of magic on humanity,

00:06:42.402 --> 00:06:44.905
in an effort to destroy the sorcerers.

00:06:45.405 --> 00:06:48.842
Those soldiers are their descendents.

00:06:49.109 --> 00:06:51.211
Sounds like a complex situation.

00:06:53.780 --> 00:06:56.883
Looks like they took Majic.

00:06:56.883 --> 00:06:58.184
Orphen, come here!

00:07:02.989 --> 00:07:03.790
It's blood.

00:07:12.799 --> 00:07:14.534
Seems I've awakened you.

00:07:16.202 --> 00:07:19.139
What are you?
What did you come to find out?

00:07:19.139 --> 00:07:20.473
What in the world...

00:07:20.473 --> 00:07:21.608
Don't play dumb!

00:07:25.278 --> 00:07:27.814
As if there were such a thing as
a sorcerer who would dare

00:07:27.814 --> 00:07:30.283
come near the Dragon Faith Village
without a reason!

00:07:30.784 --> 00:07:32.919
Dragon Faith?

00:07:32.919 --> 00:07:33.687
Speak!

00:07:42.195 --> 00:07:44.831
Herr Batrov, I've brought them!

00:07:49.336 --> 00:07:51.237
Volcan! Dortin!

00:07:51.237 --> 00:07:53.740
This isn't the right one, Herr Batrov.

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:57.944
This one can't even learn magic properly.
He's just a loser.

00:07:57.944 --> 00:08:01.114
How sad. He's in such poor condition.

00:08:03.283 --> 00:08:07.620
The other one, Orphen,
he's a really evil sorcerer.

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:10.690
| can't begin to tell you how often
he's made attempts on my life!

00:08:11.091 --> 00:08:12.659
Such lies!

00:08:15.862 --> 00:08:17.330
So, that's that.

00:08:17.330 --> 00:08:19.933
You can release us about now.

00:08:19.933 --> 00:08:21.801
Hurry up and return to work.

00:08:27.707 --> 00:08:29.075
Deep Dragon...

00:08:29.509 --> 00:08:33.446
| already regret stepping into this village.

00:08:33.446 --> 00:08:35.448
Is it that bad a place?

00:08:35.815 --> 00:08:37.384
Among those of the Dragon Faith,

00:08:37.384 --> 00:08:39.953
the inhabitants of this village
have the most skill in battle.

00:08:39.953 --> 00:08:41.121
What will you do?

00:08:41.121 --> 00:08:42.956
First, let's wait for night.

00:08:53.099 --> 00:08:57.270
Lady Fiena, what brings you to a place like this?

00:08:57.504 --> 00:08:59.839
Please leave this place.

00:09:00.240 --> 00:09:01.941
But Herr Batrov...

00:09:01.941 --> 00:09:03.043
Quickly!

00:09:03.043 --> 00:09:03.943
Yes!

00:09:11.718 --> 00:09:12.619
You?

00:09:17.924 --> 00:09:20.960
The pain is fading as if it were a lie.

00:09:23.797 --> 00:09:25.999
Please forgive the villagers.

00:09:26.599 --> 00:09:29.035
They did naught but follow
the Law of the Dragon.

00:09:29.035 --> 00:09:30.870
The Law of the Dragon?

00:09:35.408 --> 00:09:38.111
It is the sign of the priestesses
who serves the Dragon.

00:09:38.878 --> 00:09:43.049
| see. Your power is something
bestowed by a Dragon.

00:09:43.650 --> 00:09:44.951
A priestess?

00:09:44.951 --> 00:09:45.785
But...

00:09:46.786 --> 00:09:48.922
smiles suit you better.

00:09:52.158 --> 00:09:53.493
This is a problem.

00:09:55.462 --> 00:09:58.131
You cannot do as you wish in this place.

00:09:58.131 --> 00:09:59.966
Please return to the temple.

00:10:09.609 --> 00:10:11.111
Your name is?

00:10:12.912 --> 00:10:13.780
Fiena...

00:10:15.849 --> 00:10:16.850
Fiena...

00:10:43.276 --> 00:10:46.045
This is the work of the other sorcerer.

00:10:46.779 --> 00:10:48.648
Increase the watch.

00:10:48.648 --> 00:10:51.151
He may have already reached the village.

00:10:51.684 --> 00:10:52.519
Yes!

00:10:52.519 --> 00:10:53.720
You go too!

00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:54.721
Yes!

00:11:00.994 --> 00:11:04.597
So you're looking for me after all, sorcerer.

00:11:28.321 --> 00:11:29.822
Stupid Orphen!

00:11:29.822 --> 00:11:34.160
Why do I have to stay behind
when it's beginning to look interesting?

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:36.396
| don't agree at all! Really!

00:11:37.697 --> 00:11:38.698
Who's there?!

00:11:54.547 --> 00:11:55.748
What are you doing?

00:11:55.748 --> 00:11:57.917
I'm drawing a pentagram.

00:11:57.917 --> 00:11:59.586
A pentagram?

00:11:59.586 --> 00:12:02.655
Yes! With this I'm going to summon
a monster from the magic world,

00:12:02.655 --> 00:12:04.691
and then it's going to break the iron bars.

00:12:04.691 --> 00:12:07.360
Quit it! Such willfulness is not permitted!

00:12:10.697 --> 00:12:11.598
You!

00:12:13.967 --> 00:12:15.535
It was a lie, a lie.

00:12:15.535 --> 00:12:18.905
There's no way I could use a pentagram.

00:12:36.823 --> 00:12:38.258
It's me, me!

00:12:39.459 --> 00:12:40.793
Majic!

00:12:40.793 --> 00:12:42.462
How did you...

00:12:42.462 --> 00:12:44.264
Well, I wanted to talk to you.

00:12:46.032 --> 00:12:48.334
Lady Fiena, I heard a scream?

00:12:48.334 --> 00:12:52.839
I-it's nothing. I just dropped a vase, and so...

00:12:58.278 --> 00:13:00.713
Now, now, I'll clean it up.

00:13:00.713 --> 00:13:02.548
Please rest now.

00:13:02.548 --> 00:13:04.284
Is that so?

00:13:05.818 --> 00:13:08.655
Should you need something,
call upon me at anytime.

00:13:08.655 --> 00:13:09.722
Y-yes.

00:13:09.722 --> 00:13:11.524
Then by your leave...

00:13:11.791 --> 00:13:13.293
G-goodnight.

00:13:17.964 --> 00:13:19.465
Saved!

00:13:28.675 --> 00:13:30.510
You finally laughed.

00:13:36.549 --> 00:13:37.483
Paw!

00:13:39.419 --> 00:13:40.520
Again!

00:13:41.688 --> 00:13:42.789
Beg!

00:13:47.126 --> 00:13:48.328
I like you!

00:13:48.328 --> 00:13:50.630
From this day on, you're mine.

00:13:54.934 --> 00:14:01.841
And that flower garden, the flowers only bloom
every few years during the annular eclipse.

00:14:01.841 --> 00:14:03.509
Isn't it strange?

00:14:04.477 --> 00:14:05.978
Are you bored?

00:14:07.080 --> 00:14:08.715
Please tell me more!

00:14:08.715 --> 00:14:12.051
Everything about the outside
world that you know, Majic!

00:14:13.119 --> 00:14:15.855
Haven't you ever been outside this village?

00:14:18.791 --> 00:14:22.995
| just look out at the world outside the window,
dreaming of what could be.

00:14:25.965 --> 00:14:27.300
Let's go then, Fiena!

00:14:27.967 --> 00:14:30.470
Come with us, into the big world!

00:14:30.670 --> 00:14:34.474
There are a lot of things you
don't know about waiting for you there!

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:35.708
Majic...

00:14:37.009 --> 00:14:40.880
As a priestess my fate and this village are one.

00:14:41.614 --> 00:14:44.083
It is not allowed for me
to venture outside the village.

00:14:44.083 --> 00:14:45.385
Why?

00:14:45.385 --> 00:14:47.787
It is the law of the village.

00:14:47.787 --> 00:14:49.522
That's not right!

00:14:49.789 --> 00:14:54.460
You and the other villagers shouldn't be trapped
just because of some weird law!

00:14:54.460 --> 00:14:58.097
| want to go into the outside world!

00:14:58.097 --> 00:15:00.166
| want to see it, but...

00:15:01.267 --> 00:15:03.136
But I...

00:15:04.103 --> 00:15:04.971
Fiena...

00:15:06.038 --> 00:15:09.375
Majic, let's end this talk.

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:15.148
More importantly, I am worried,
about that man they call Batrov.

00:15:15.581 --> 00:15:18.117
Batrov? Who is he?

00:15:18.484 --> 00:15:21.320
He is a person from the outside world.

00:15:21.320 --> 00:15:24.557
He brought medicines to
this village with no doctor.

00:15:24.557 --> 00:15:26.058
Medicines?

00:15:26.526 --> 00:15:30.797
Drugs made by something we know
nothing about called chemistry.

00:15:30.797 --> 00:15:35.034
Now the villagers trust him, but...

00:15:35.034 --> 00:15:35.968
But?

00:15:36.702 --> 00:15:39.505
| feel as though that man
will bring strife to our village.

00:15:39.505 --> 00:15:41.507
| have such an evil premonition.

00:15:48.281 --> 00:15:49.582
It's gunpowder.

00:15:50.383 --> 00:15:52.819
Why is something like that in this village?

00:15:59.125 --> 00:16:02.895
How long do they plan to
keep us at this hard labor?!

00:16:02.895 --> 00:16:06.032
| am the glorious Volcan Polkano!

00:16:06.799 --> 00:16:09.035
I'm just glad that we're alive.

00:16:09.035 --> 00:16:12.472
What if something horrible
happens to that apprentice sorcerer?

00:16:12.472 --> 00:16:16.008
That awful sorcerer will turn us into teriyaki.

00:16:16.008 --> 00:16:19.212
Then wondrous me will
turn his attack back upon him!

00:16:21.447 --> 00:16:23.216
You're the wrong one, Big Brother!

00:16:23.216 --> 00:16:26.652
Because you let slip that there
was a sorcerer near by...

00:16:26.652 --> 00:16:27.987
Now I see.

00:16:31.157 --> 00:16:35.194
So that's how the sorcerer hunters
arrived with such good timing.

00:16:37.830 --> 00:16:42.568
I-idiot! Stupendous me was
coerced by some Batrov guy,

00:16:42.568 --> 00:16:45.204
and confessed it all with a heavy heart!

00:16:45.204 --> 00:16:47.206
Got a problem with that, do you?!

00:16:48.841 --> 00:16:51.911
Batrov? I've heard that name...

00:16:51.911 --> 00:16:54.013
He's a strangely suspicious guy

00:16:54.013 --> 00:16:58.384
and he's having the villagers
make this gunpowder in secret.

00:17:01.888 --> 00:17:03.556
The sorcerer has escaped!

00:17:03.823 --> 00:17:04.924
Go find him!

00:17:05.258 --> 00:17:06.492
After him!

00:17:07.760 --> 00:17:09.662
Hey, you, stupid sorcerer!

00:17:11.264 --> 00:17:12.565
These chains?

00:17:13.833 --> 00:17:16.068
Be grateful you have your lives, at least.

00:17:16.903 --> 00:17:19.405
That jerk! Damn...

00:17:20.072 --> 00:17:21.707
Hurry! Escape quickly!

00:17:21.707 --> 00:17:22.942
You escape too!

00:17:22.942 --> 00:17:25.678
Majic, please don't trouble me any further!

00:17:27.179 --> 00:17:29.215
Bringing a sorcerer into your room.

00:17:29.215 --> 00:17:31.384
This is a problem, Lady Fiena.

00:17:31.384 --> 00:17:32.552
Batrov!

00:17:32.919 --> 00:17:37.223
Sorcerer, I knew I should have
finished you off to begin with.

00:17:37.223 --> 00:17:38.224
Don't!

00:17:40.927 --> 00:17:41.794
Fiena!

00:17:42.528 --> 00:17:43.796
You're in my way!

00:17:48.067 --> 00:17:48.834
Fiena!

00:17:51.604 --> 00:17:53.172
Fiena? Fiena?!

00:17:53.973 --> 00:17:55.308
Yo, Batrov!

00:17:55.675 --> 00:17:56.709
Who are you?

00:17:56.709 --> 00:17:57.810
Master!

00:17:58.177 --> 00:18:00.313
He'll kill anything for money.

00:18:00.313 --> 00:18:01.981
He's a poacher.

00:18:01.981 --> 00:18:03.115
Isn't that right?

00:18:03.883 --> 00:18:05.051
A poacher?

00:18:05.051 --> 00:18:06.953
He deals in rare animals.

00:18:06.953 --> 00:18:10.957
The Tower of Fangs has a warrant out
for the arrest of this loser.

00:18:10.957 --> 00:18:16.696
So, that's it! You used the village laws
to hide from your pursuers!

00:18:16.696 --> 00:18:18.631
So, what about it?

00:18:18.631 --> 00:18:22.435
Whatever my reasons, in this village
they kill sorcerers, just like me.

00:18:22.702 --> 00:18:25.304
You, what are you planning
to do with this village?

00:18:25.304 --> 00:18:26.706
What about that gunpowder?

00:18:26.706 --> 00:18:27.707
Shut up!

00:18:29.175 --> 00:18:31.210
Breath of an Angel that I let flow!

00:18:36.582 --> 00:18:37.617
Now...

00:18:37.617 --> 00:18:38.884
Please wait!

00:18:39.485 --> 00:18:44.490
| can't leave her in this kind of place.

00:18:55.301 --> 00:18:56.802
Kidnapping?!

00:18:59.205 --> 00:19:01.340
I'll explain later.

00:19:01.340 --> 00:19:03.843
Let's regroup.

00:19:03.843 --> 00:19:05.911
We'll deal with Batrov after that.

00:19:07.046 --> 00:19:08.748
Cleao, that's...

00:19:08.748 --> 00:19:10.316
| found him!

00:19:11.283 --> 00:19:12.385
Isn't he cute?!

00:19:12.985 --> 00:19:16.155
Are you saying that knowing who he is?

00:19:17.056 --> 00:19:18.290
Not at all.

00:19:20.359 --> 00:19:22.028
That is Deep Dragon's child.

00:19:22.595 --> 00:19:23.963
Deep Dragon's?

00:19:26.766 --> 00:19:28.000
You're awake!

00:19:28.334 --> 00:19:29.602
Majic...

00:19:34.807 --> 00:19:37.443
It's all right. Everyone's on our side.

00:19:50.656 --> 00:19:51.657
Fiena?

00:19:54.360 --> 00:19:56.662
It seems the air's changed!

00:19:58.130 --> 00:19:59.131
That's it.

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:02.568
It's coming.

00:20:08.841 --> 00:20:10.009
Wait!

00:20:10.376 --> 00:20:11.644
Come back, Cleao!

00:20:11.644 --> 00:20:13.179
Master!

00:20:23.122 --> 00:20:24.423
Deep Dragon...

00:20:32.198 --> 00:20:33.332
Damn...

00:20:44.343 --> 00:20:46.412
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:20:49.682 --> 00:20:51.784
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:21:04.530 --> 00:21:05.765
Master!

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:16.242
Master...

00:21:16.509 --> 00:21:17.343
Fiena!

00:21:31.223 --> 00:21:32.658
| beg of you!

00:21:33.459 --> 00:21:36.195
Please forgive these humans.

00:21:44.637 --> 00:21:45.871
| beg you!

00:21:51.944 --> 00:21:53.312
Master!

00:22:01.921 --> 00:22:04.290
Master? Master!

00:22:04.757 --> 00:22:06.458
Master!

00:22:14.200 --> 00:22:17.903
Damn, at this rate, we'll all bite it.

00:22:17.903 --> 00:22:20.906
Fiena, I beg you. Please heal my Master!

00:22:22.374 --> 00:22:25.744
Batrov is trying to catch
the child of Deep Dragon?

00:22:26.478 --> 00:22:29.682
If he does that, Deep Dragon
will go mad with grief,

00:22:29.682 --> 00:22:31.650
and the village will be annihilated.

00:22:32.151 --> 00:22:34.053
Next time on Sorcerous Stabber Orphen:

00:22:34.053 --> 00:22:36.255
the wolf that CRIES IN OUR FOREST
"The Wolf that Cries in Our Forest."

00:22:36.255 --> 00:22:38.424
The wolf that CRIES IN OUR FOREST
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:22:38.424 --> 00:22:38.858
The wolf that
CRIES IN OUR FOREST

00:22:49.201 --> 00:22:53.272
You aren't here, the one I really love

00:22:53.272 --> 00:22:57.343
My first love has reached a dead end

00:22:57.810 --> 00:23:06.051
Tonight in my dreams, a smiling you doesn't appear

00:23:06.685 --> 00:23:10.723
Your last lines came out of your lips too soon

00:23:10.723 --> 00:23:14.326
You were troubled by

00:23:15.261 --> 00:23:19.198
Your last lines as soon as your lips said them

00:23:19.198 --> 00:23:22.935
But then you kissed me

00:23:24.003 --> 00:23:28.407
To only my lips

00:23:28.407 --> 00:23:32.611
Please give your warmth

00:23:32.611 --> 00:23:36.982
To only my lips

00:23:36.982 --> 00:23:40.853
Will you always remain

00:23:41.120 --> 00:23:43.589
A gentle you

00:23:43.589 --> 00:23:47.760
To only my lips

00:23:47.760 --> 00:23:52.064
No matter how hard I try to forget

00:23:52.064 --> 00:23:56.335
To only my lips

00:23:56.335 --> 00:24:02.541
Will you always remain

00:24:02.875 --> 00:24:07.479
The last of you
